          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Mar 26 2025 21:24:32 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Experience. Expertise. For every ASC.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Breaking ground on an ASC? Expanding your existing center? Let’s connect at AAHKS! The Stryker team will be onsite in Grapevine from <b>October 23</b>&nbsp;to <b>October 26 </b>at the <b>Gaylord Texan Resort and Convention Center</b>.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Visit us at booth #1007 in the exhibit hall to learn more about the ASC New Build Playbook, created to be your step-by-step guide on ASC new builds and expansions&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a href=\"#contact\">Schedule dedicated time</a> with our team to discuss where you are in your new build journey and learn how we can help support you</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Aug 28 2025 18:51:19 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
